From: Kartudev <146179713+Kartudev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:20:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(update): build-time FERRO_UPDATE_REPO to point the
 updater at a fork

Forks that publish their own builds (same asset names as release.yml) can
set FERRO_UPDATE_REPO=owner/name when building; the release URL, release
page and cargo install command then name that repository. Malformed values
fall back to FerroApps/Ferrocord.
